    "text": "Tins of September 2013, each with one of three Team Plasma Pokémon-EX with new art, Thundurus-EX BW81, Deoxys-EX BW82 or Lugia-EX BW83, four Black & White Series booster packs and a code card that unlocked the same card in the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online. Each was redrawn by the artist of the expansion card. A European distributor had announced the three tins that April."
